The converter probes captures with a reference DI signal that this project
does not include or distribute. It is downloaded at the time of use from
SonicMaster's repository at commit 931a68f and used only if its SHA-256 matches
(packages/core/src/clo/reference-di.ts). SonicMaster describes it as the same
signal the official Sonicake tool bundles.

packages/core/test/fixtures/clo/ref_input.nam is SonicMaster's test capture
(app/rust/tests/fixtures). The *.golden.f32 files next to it are outputs of
SonicMaster's own clo_dsp.dart, run on that capture and on a synthetic DI, which
the tests compare against.
